{"4151830":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Nippets: A Hidden Object Game","steam_appid":4151830,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4572960,4572980],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/7ee88128f61c66b76d24eb67b8d6a7e6.poster.avif?t=1782385514\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" width=448 height=189 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >들여다보고, 찔러보고, 건드려보면서 숨어있는 타겟과, 작은 퍼즐이 가득한 손으로 그린 2D지도를 헤치고 나아가세요.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/00d3ed90a841eaaec53738d56ce3e74e.poster.avif?t=1782385514\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/00d3ed90a841eaaec53738d56ce3e74e.mp4?t=1782385514\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >나무를 잡아당기고, 사물을 회전시키고, 비밀문을 열어 이 세계를 고향이라 부르는 작고 특별한 생명체들을 만나보세요.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/92ea93eaeb969463faf46b2b6dbba305.poster.avif?t=1782385514\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/92ea93eaeb969463faf46b2b6dbba305.mp4?t=1782385514\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >몇몇 이야기들은 계절내내 이어지니, 탐험을 계속해 무슨 일이 벌어지게 될지 지켜보세요!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/74142d7cfe30e98f3532b3f9d53eff26.poster.avif?t=1782385514\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/74142d7cfe30e98f3532b3f9d53eff26.mp4?t=1782385514\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >일련의 단서들은 무엇을 발견할지를 알려줍니다.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/f964984336a71a66000c8fc0e0a2cc6f.poster.avif?t=1782385514\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/f964984336a71a66000c8fc0e0a2cc6f.mp4?t=1782385514\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >퍼즐을 풀어 더 많은 지역을 잠금 해제하고 더 큰 놀라움을 위해 지도마다 존재하는 3~5개의 탐험구역에 빠져들어보세요.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/3a101d97e7498c1e59227375e6e44ad0.poster.avif?t=1782385514\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" width=1152 height=450 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >도망중인 소시지가 비밀... 혹은 이야기를 숨기고 있을줄 누가 알았을까요?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/377b8c19513e563e1df8b7eae132b317.webp?t=1782385514\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4151830\/extras\/377b8c19513e563e1df8b7eae132b317.poster.avif?t=1782385514\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=281 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_i